      "blockers": "Un-held 2026-10-04 (Ben): ships in the next release as detections only (edna_presence = 1 and read counts; the archive holds positive detections only, so no row is not a non-detection). Q08 (omitted zero-detection runs) stays open, now high; Q07 (read filtering, controls) and Q06 (ASV/PCR-replicate summing) stay open. 2026-10-01 rework of PR #118 (review decision B4): obs = one row per filter x taxon x measurement_type -- edna_presence (shared with sio_cetacean-edna; 1 only, positive detections) + edna_reads_dloop / edna_reads_12s (reads summed over ASVs and PCR replicates); no obs_attribute; sample_key calcofi_2022-edna:filter:<parentEventID>; sample_measurement carries nutrients/chl_fluor/oxygen_mg_l/dna_concentration + per-assay raw and filtered read totals; 'OTUs or ASVs assigned to taxa' held back (Q04: equals the summed reads). Rendered + uploaded to gs://calcofi-db/ingest/calcofi_2022-edna/ 2026-10-01: sample 47 / obs 148 / sample_measurement 482. site_key/parent_sample_key NULL pending Q05.",
